    "chunk_text": "\ufffda w\u00e6s efter medmicelum f\u00e6ce, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s untrymnesse gestonden, & on \u00fe\u00e6re his dagas & his lichoman se ilca ealdormon Eorconwald onfeng, & in portice his cirican sumre geheold, \u00dea w\u00e6s geworden \u00e6fter seofon & twentegum daga, \u00fea dydon heo his lichoman up of \u00feam \u00dea w\u00e6s he meted swa unsce\u00f0ed, swa he in \u00fea ilcan tid of \u00feissum leohte gel\u00e6ded w\u00e6re. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00e6fter feower wintrum eft, \u00fe\u00e6t mon o\u00f0re cirican getimbrede: & him eallum \u00feuhte \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00dea gena he buton womme gebrosnunge w\u00e6s gemeted, & heo hine \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6r mid wyr\u00f0re are Ond \u00fe\u00e6r his geearnunge oft \u00feurh godcunde wyrcnesse mid miclum m\u00e6genum scina\u00f0 & Betweoh \u00f0as \u00f0ing \u00f0a for\u00f0ferdum Felice Eastengla biscope \u00e6fter seofontyne gearum his \u00fe\u00e6s & \u00fees w\u00e6s \u00e6fter fif gearum his biscophade of \u00feissum leohte al\u00e6ded. \u00dea w\u00e6s Berhtgels, o\u00f0re noman Bonefatius, of Cantwara m\u00e6g\u00f0e in his stowe to biscope geseted. Ond he \u00f0a swylce Honorius se \u00e6rcebiscop, \u00e6fter \u00feon \u00fee he \u00fea gem\u00e6ro his yrnes gefylde, of Ond \u00fea blonn se biscophad eall ger & \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00f0res syx moona\u00f0. \u00dea w\u00e6s gecoren sexta \u00e6rcebiscop Deosdedit to \u00fe\u00e6m se\u00f0le Contwara burge, se w\u00e6s of \u00dea w\u00e6s he gehalgad \u00fey seofo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge Kalendarum Aprelium, ond he \u00fe",
